WEBVTT

00:12:29.817 --> 00:12:32.784
And there will be no formula
for how to get it back."

00:12:33.672 --> 00:12:36.190
But they offered me
this little piece of reassurance,

00:12:36.214 --> 00:12:37.576
and I clung to it.

00:12:38.375 --> 00:12:39.545
They said,

00:12:39.569 --> 00:12:42.663
"When the feelings recede like the tides,

00:12:42.687 --> 00:12:44.480
they will leave an imprint."

00:12:45.806 --> 00:12:47.272
And they do.

00:12:47.887 --> 00:12:50.970
And it is not proof of anything,

00:12:51.906 --> 00:12:53.740
and it is nothing to boast about.

00:12:53.764 --> 00:12:55.395
It was just a gift.

00:12:55.419 --> 00:12:58.284
So I can't respond to
the thousands of emails I get

00:12:58.308 --> 00:13:00.992
with my own five-step plan
to divine health